=======
\* Normalize input: remove whitespace, lowercase, trim
Normalize(input) ==
LET
trimmed == SelectSeq(input, LAMBDA c: c /= " " AND c /= "\n" AND c /= "\t")
lowered == [i \in 1..Len(trimmed) |->
IF trimmed[i] >= "A" AND trimmed[i] <= "Z"
THEN CHR(ORD(trimmed[i]) + 32)
ELSE trimmed[i]]
IN lowered
\* Deterministic hash function for routing
Hash(input) ==
LET
h == 0
\* Simple deterministic hash (FNV-1a style)
FNV_PRIME == 16777619
FNV_OFFSET == 2166136261
hash == FoldSeq(LAMBDA acc, c: (acc XOR ORD(c)) * FNV_PRIME, FNV_OFFSET,
input)
IN hash
\* Deterministic triage: maps hash to tile ID or 0 (ambiguous)
TriageFunction(input) ==
LET
h == Hash(input)
tile == h % Cardinality(Tiles) + 1 \* Deterministic modulo
\* Ambiguity check: if hash falls in ambiguous range
ambiguous == (h % 100) < 5 \* 5% ambiguity threshold
IN IF ambiguous THEN 0 ELSE tile
\* Deterministic tile inference (ternary XNOR + popcount)
TileInference(tile, input) ==
\* Returns result string deterministically
\* Implementation: ternary matvec with XNOR + popcount
\* This is specified but not expanded in TLA+ for brevity
"RESULT_" \* Placeholder for actual implementation \*
